{"text": {"Morrow": "Yeah1 Group", "Northbeam": "1Creators Platform", "Hana": "SYE Holdings", "Orbit": "MangoPlus", "Field": "UIT AI Chatbot", "NoveQ": "Every Half AI Chatbot", "Luma": "Phan Kim Design", "Relay": "Bích Thủy Portfolio", "Remy Blanc": "Trung Kien Nguyen", "Remy": "KIIN", "hello@remy.design": "hello@kiin.ai", "Book a Call": "Contact Me", "Product designer": "Manual & AI QA Tester", "Based in France": "Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam", "I'm Remy, a product designer based in France with 8 years of experience\nturning early ideas into polished, purposeful digital products.": "I’m Trung Kien Nguyen, a Manual QA Tester based in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam, currently working at 1Creators. I test websites, mobile applications, internal administration systems, and AI-powered chatbots.", "Services": "Testing Expertise", "Product Design": "Functional Testing", "UI/UX Design": "UI/UX Validation", "Brand Identity": "AI Chatbot Testing", "Design Systems": "Admin System Testing", "Web Design": "Web & Mobile Testing", "Clients": "Projects", "Nike": "Yeah1 Group", "Airbnb": "1Creators Platform", "Spotify": "SYE Holdings", "Google": "MangoPlus", "Adobe": "UIT AI Chatbot", "Samsung": "Every Half AI Chatbot", "Tools": "Testing Process", "Figma": "Requirement Analysis", "Framer": "Test Case Design", "Lovable": "Testing & Bug Reporting", "Midjourney": "Bug Reproduction", "Claude": "Regression Testing", "After Effects": "Release Support", "Remy - Minimal Portfolio Framer Template": "KIIN — Manual & AI QA Tester", "I'm Remy, a product designer based in France with 8 years of experience": "I’m Trung Kien Nguyen, a Manual QA Tester based in Ho Chi Minh City, Vietnam, currently working at 1Creators.", "turning early ideas into polished, purposeful digital products.": "I have hands-on experience testing websites, mobile applications, internal administration systems, and AI-powered chatbots across education, e-commerce, entertainment, and creator platforms. My testing work focuses on functionality, user interface, responsive behavior, AI response quality, anti-fraud scenarios, bug tracking, and identifying edge cases that may affect the user experience. I collaborate with developers and product teams to reproduce issues, verify fixes, perform regression testing, and support stable, reliable product releases."}, "images": {"26452f33.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/tBUrMdh33fEYS1TkOF9KUiws9c.png?width=1200&height=825", "887fb21d.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/tBUrMdh33fEYS1TkOF9KUiws9c.png?width=1200&height=825", "1b6bd6e4.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/tBUrMdh33fEYS1TkOF9KUiws9c.png?width=1200&height=825", "ed68ad3a.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/8uBrJUItKnk2lu9o9eBzALhIY.png?width=1586&height=992", "c9ca2d61.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/8uBrJUItKnk2lu9o9eBzALhIY.png?width=1586&height=992", "cdb9db72.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/Mx2RAhokexM2LaoyUQJl2dWMp9k.png?width=1568&height=1003", "f91b1e70.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/Mx2RAhokexM2LaoyUQJl2dWMp9k.png?width=1568&height=1003", "a2e2649d.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/Mx2RAhokexM2LaoyUQJl2dWMp9k.png?width=1568&height=1003", "ea53aed2.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/Mx2RAhokexM2LaoyUQJl2dWMp9k.png?width=1568&height=1003", "291614e2.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/TPOTFYjFLCDbwjehXfRR9SCnZ94.png?width=1200&height=825", "e5de3e0f.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/TPOTFYjFLCDbwjehXfRR9SCnZ94.png?width=1200&height=825", "98ce66e0.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/TPOTFYjFLCDbwjehXfRR9SCnZ94.png?width=1200&height=825", "ef8961b0.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/QmJO0sNC9FYzW7mU46EjCsoh9g.png?width=1536&height=1024", "9f109320.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/SEayEoNLuqcgNy2Uz3dkwpOTYs.png?width=1586&height=992", "40c1d6c6.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/SEayEoNLuqcgNy2Uz3dkwpOTYs.png?width=1586&height=992", "eca12a67.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/SEayEoNLuqcgNy2Uz3dkwpOTYs.png?width=1586&height=992", "6d3823bc.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/SEayEoNLuqcgNy2Uz3dkwpOTYs.png?width=1586&height=992", "f29c70ca.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/X08h7ztCyniTNVNY8OoESaAog.png?width=1200&height=825", "b9e2242d.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/X08h7ztCyniTNVNY8OoESaAog.png?width=1200&height=825", "e0597a94.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/PTZ2PZG1uDniHdseCBkvMSMjwA.png?width=1200&height=825", "b701c87a.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/PTZ2PZG1uDniHdseCBkvMSMjwA.png?width=1200&height=825", "122e8861.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/PTZ2PZG1uDniHdseCBkvMSMjwA.png?width=1200&height=825", "8127b637.jpg": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/3kh27uqtqhub5ai1xO9Og2JFv0.jpg?width=736&height=736"}, "pages": {"/work/morrow/": {"text": {"Morrow is a personal finance experience that helps people understand their money and make confident decisions.": "Website QA Testing — Yeah1 Group.", "Morrow’s financial tools were powerful but intimidating. Important information was spread across dashboards, and users had to decode complex charts before they could answer simple questions about their spending and goals.": "Website QA Testing — Yeah1 Group.", "The product was redesigned around plain-language insights and progressive disclosure. A focused overview surfaced the few decisions that mattered today, while deeper views gave confident users more control when they needed it.": "Website QA Testing — Yeah1 Group.", "Create a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.": "", "Live preview": "View Project", "Client": "Project", "Scope": "Testing Scope", "Duration": "Role", "The Problem": "Testing Focus", "The Solution": "Testing Process", "5 months": "QA Tester", "Morrow Finance": "Yeah1 Group", "Field Notes": "Yeah1 Group", "Orbit Health": "Yeah1 Group", "Luma Commerce": "Yeah1 Group", "Relay Workspace": "Yeah1 Group", "Framer Template": "Yeah1 Group"}, "image": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/tBUrMdh33fEYS1TkOF9KUiws9c.png?width=1200&height=825"}, "/work/northbeam/": {"text": {"Northbeam is a smart-home platform that helps residents manage energy usage, security, and building services from a single app.": "Tested the internal website and mobile application, including content, livestream, messaging, voting, ticket purchasing and cross-device compatibility.", "Northbeam's early prototype worked, but users found it confusing and inconsistent. Core actions, like adjusting the thermostat or checking a security camera, were buried three or four taps deep, and the visual design changed from screen to screen with no shared design language.": "Tested the internal website and mobile application, including content, livestream, messaging, voting, ticket purchasing and cross-device compatibility.", "Remy started by mapping the full user journey to identify the moments that mattered most, checking in on the home, responding to alerts, and adjusting settings quickly. From there, the information architecture was rebuilt around three clear tabs instead of a sprawling menu, cutting the average task time by more than half.": "Tested the internal website and mobile application, including content, livestream, messaging, voting, ticket purchasing and cross-device compatibility.", "Create a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.": "", "Live preview": "View Project", "Client": "Project", "Scope": "Testing Scope", "Duration": "Role", "The Problem": "Testing Focus", "The Solution": "Testing Process", "4 months": "QA Tester", "Morrow Finance": "1Creators Platform", "Field Notes": "1Creators Platform", "Orbit Health": "1Creators Platform", "Luma Commerce": "1Creators Platform", "Relay Workspace": "1Creators Platform", "Framer Template": "1Creators Platform"}, "image": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/8uBrJUItKnk2lu9o9eBzALhIY.png?width=1586&height=992"}, "/work/hana/": {"text": {"Hana is a minimal portfolio template designed for visual & motion designers, creatives, and photographers.": "Tested the public website and internal admin system, including content workflows, permissions, data synchronization and responsive UI.", "features an interactive cursor overlay, built to showcase your work with clarity and intention. Whether you're showcasing brand identity, digital design, motion work, or photography, Hana gives your portfolio a clean, editorial feel, confident enough to make an impression, restrained enough to let the work speak for itself.": "Tested the public website and internal admin system, including content workflows, permissions, data synchronization and responsive UI.", "Create a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.": "", "Live preview": "View Project", "Client": "Project", "Scope": "Testing Scope", "Duration": "Role", "The Problem": "Testing Focus", "The Solution": "Testing Process", "2 weeks": "QA Tester", "Morrow Finance": "SYE Holdings", "Field Notes": "SYE Holdings", "Orbit Health": "SYE Holdings", "Luma Commerce": "SYE Holdings", "Relay Workspace": "SYE Holdings", "Framer Template": "SYE Holdings"}, "image": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/Mx2RAhokexM2LaoyUQJl2dWMp9k.png?width=1568&height=1003"}, "/work/orbit/": {"text": {"Orbit Health is a digital care platform that makes everyday wellness feel clear, calm, and actionable.": "Web & Mobile App QA Testing — MangoPlus.", "Orbit Health had strong clinical content, but the product made everyday wellness feel difficult to navigate. Users struggled to understand what to do next and lost context between check-ins, plans, and progress.": "Web & Mobile App QA Testing — MangoPlus.", "The experience was reorganized around a simple daily rhythm: check in, understand the signal, and take one useful action. Clear progress cues and calmer content hierarchy made the platform feel more supportive without removing depth.": "Web & Mobile App QA Testing — MangoPlus.", "Create a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.": "", "Live preview": "View Project", "Client": "Project", "Scope": "Testing Scope", "Duration": "Role", "The Problem": "Testing Focus", "The Solution": "Testing Process", "3 months": "QA Tester", "Morrow Finance": "MangoPlus", "Field Notes": "MangoPlus", "Orbit Health": "MangoPlus", "Luma Commerce": "MangoPlus", "Relay Workspace": "MangoPlus", "Framer Template": "MangoPlus"}, "image": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/TPOTFYjFLCDbwjehXfRR9SCnZ94.png?width=1200&height=825"}, "/work/field/": {"text": {"Field Notes is a collaborative research workspace for teams turning customer conversations into sharper product direction.": "AI Chatbot Testing — UIT AI Chatbot.", "Field Notes began as a collection of research tools, but teams struggled to turn scattered interviews into shared understanding. Notes, themes, and decisions lived in different places and were difficult to connect.": "AI Chatbot Testing — UIT AI Chatbot.", "The workspace was shaped around the journey from conversation to decision. Research could be captured quickly, grouped into themes, and shared as concise evidence, giving teams a clearer path from raw notes to product direction.": "AI Chatbot Testing — UIT AI Chatbot.", "Create a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.": "", "Live preview": "View Project", "Client": "Project", "Scope": "Testing Scope", "Duration": "Role", "The Problem": "Testing Focus", "The Solution": "Testing Process", "4 months": "QA Tester", "Morrow Finance": "UIT AI Chatbot", "Field Notes": "UIT AI Chatbot", "Orbit Health": "UIT AI Chatbot", "Luma Commerce": "UIT AI Chatbot", "Relay Workspace": "UIT AI Chatbot", "Framer Template": "UIT AI Chatbot"}, "image": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/QmJO0sNC9FYzW7mU46EjCsoh9g.png?width=1536&height=1024"}, "/work/noveq/": {"text": {"NoveQ® is a premium template built for modern AI agencies and consulting firms who want a website that looks as polished as the work they do.": "is a premium template built for modern AI agencies and consulting firms who want a website that looks as polished as the work they do.", "is a premium template built for modern AI agencies and consulting firms who want a website that looks as polished as the work they do.": "is a premium template built for modern AI agencies and consulting firms who want a website that looks as polished as the work they do.", "Built with flexibility at its core, NoveQ works straight out of the box for a wide range of modern agencies and service businesses. Every section is fully customizable and crafted to convert visitors into clients.": "is a premium template built for modern AI agencies and consulting firms who want a website that looks as polished as the work they do.", "Create a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.": "", "Live preview": "View Project", "Client": "Project", "Scope": "Testing Scope", "Duration": "Role", "The Problem": "Testing Focus", "The Solution": "Testing Process", "2 weeks": "QA Tester", "Morrow Finance": "Every Half AI Chatbot", "Field Notes": "Every Half AI Chatbot", "Orbit Health": "Every Half AI Chatbot", "Luma Commerce": "Every Half AI Chatbot", "Relay Workspace": "Every Half AI Chatbot", "Framer Template": "Every Half AI Chatbot"}, "image": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/SEayEoNLuqcgNy2Uz3dkwpOTYs.png?width=1586&height=992"}, "/work/luma/": {"text": {"Luma is a modern commerce platform designed to make discovery, checkout, and repeat purchases feel effortless.": "Website Design, Development & QA — Phan Kim Design.", "Luma’s shopping journey was visually polished but fragmented. Discovery, product comparison, and checkout each felt like separate experiences, making it harder for customers to stay oriented and complete a purchase.": "Website Design, Development & QA — Phan Kim Design.", "The flow was rebuilt as one continuous journey with stronger comparison patterns, clearer product context, and a more reassuring checkout. The visual system was simplified so the products could carry more of the attention.": "Website Design, Development & QA — Phan Kim Design.", "Create a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.": "", "Live preview": "View Project", "Client": "Project", "Scope": "Testing Scope", "Duration": "Role", "The Problem": "Testing Focus", "The Solution": "Testing Process", "6 months": "QA Tester", "Morrow Finance": "Phan Kim Design", "Field Notes": "Phan Kim Design", "Orbit Health": "Phan Kim Design", "Luma Commerce": "Phan Kim Design", "Relay Workspace": "Phan Kim Design", "Framer Template": "Phan Kim Design"}, "image": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/X08h7ztCyniTNVNY8OoESaAog.png?width=1200&height=825"}, "/work/relay/": {"text": {"Relay brings projects, conversations, and decisions into one focused workspace for growing teams.": "Website Design, Development & QA — Bích Thủy Portfolio.", "Relay helped teams manage projects and conversations, but important decisions were easily buried in busy channels. People had to search across multiple surfaces to understand what had changed and why.": "Website Design, Development & QA — Bích Thủy Portfolio.", "The product introduced a clearer relationship between work, conversation, and decisions. Updates were given a durable home beside the relevant project context, helping teams move from discussion to action with less backtracking.": "Website Design, Development & QA — Bích Thủy Portfolio.", "Create a free website with Framer, the website builder loved by startups, designers and agencies.": "", "Live preview": "View Project", "Client": "Project", "Scope": "Testing Scope", "Duration": "Role", "The Problem": "Testing Focus", "The Solution": "Testing Process", "4 months": "QA T